Crop of the Players Committee card image [[:File:V9-D-vanee_ai-2023-12-02.png]] (after the change to [[Vaneé (ALT) (Errata)]]): pixels 39–159 × 45–139 of the 745×1039 image. Cropped only; no other edits.

